1
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:07,037
On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,
but inside, I've still got a human soul!

2
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,337
In this new world of wonders,

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:11,797
I travel to and fro on the back of
my super strong partner, Lammis!

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,140
The name's Boxxo! Hello there!

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,068
That means yes, by the way!

6
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,960
Leave him to me.

7
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,986
Has Heavy always had
such superhuman strength?

8
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,729
I knew he had blessing
of might like Lamas,

9
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,457
but I guess he's been
holding back this whole time.

10
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:49,893
Seems like a lie by omission and he
claims not to believe in telling lies.

11
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,660
What are you?

12
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,277
Some kind of monster?

13
00:00:57,360 --> 00:01:00,125
Sir, a clergyman going
around murdering people.

14
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:03,840
I am a human being first
and a clergyman second.

15
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,780
Please, I'm sorry.

16
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,631
I'll quit my bandit ways.

17
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:10,280
I beg you, sir, just spare my life.

18
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:12,740
The gods say that death is serene.

19
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:17,597
It comes to each of us impartially, but
there is one point on which I beg to differ.

20
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:21,340
Death itself may very well
be impartial. Have mercy!

21
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,817
I'll pay whatever you ask!

22
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:26,637
Those who meet out death must not be
impartial where scumbags are concerned.

23
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,277
DO YOU WANT WOMEN OR RINCES?

24
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,190
PLEASE!

25
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:39,240
DON'T KILL ME. PLEASE. DON'T KILL ME.

26
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,830
ENOUGH.

27
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:44,377
DON'T THINK YOU CAN MAKE A FOOL OF ME.

28
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:46,166
YOU WON'T GET AWAY WITH THIS!

29
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,576
YOU IDIOTS ARE FINISHED, YOU HEAR ME!

30
00:01:57,060 --> 00:01:58,240
The Stratum Lord.

31
00:01:58,460 --> 00:01:59,560
It has to be.

32
00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:02,597
The ogre that dwells on the
top floor of the desert pillar?

33
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,280
That is the Stratum Lord. You're all dead.

34
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,780
Say goodbye and meet your end.

35
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:09,760
Awake, dual ogre!

36
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,717
Is it meal time?

37
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,020
I love meal time.

38
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:15,692
And the eating is good today, my monster.

39
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,100
Stop! Don't eat me!

40
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,017
That one is my prey
and I shan't yield him.

41
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:29,737
Hey you you can't steal from us!

42
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:31,517
I could say the same thing to you.

43
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:34,077
I staked my claim on him first, after all.

44
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:38,160
Current time, let's go.

45
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,457
I'll deal with him.

46
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:44,577
Please be careful.

47
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:47,337
I promised you I'd help and I will.

48
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:49,217
Please know how I appreciate it.

49
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,657
Let's hurry up.

50
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:52,137
We can take down this monster.

51
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:53,050
I know it.

52
00:02:53,133 --> 00:02:55,897
Master Boxo and the rest of
us will make quick work of it.

53
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:59,877
Meat meat everywhere.

54
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,357
What can we make a meal of them?

55
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:04,337
Save the thighs and entrails for me now.

56
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:07,300
Time for this stratum's final showdown.

57
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,780
Take that!

58
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:18,920
Better not underestimate
us! What? No! Wait a minute!

59
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,180
Uh-oh! Barrier time!

60
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,640
Points decreased by 2,222.

61
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:30,900
I only lost a thousand points when that
monstrous eight-legged crocodile rammed me!

62
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:34,917
You won't smash us! Dumb human!

63
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,220
What's going on?

64
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,635
Why didn't that take down the monster?

65
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:44,877
If those attacks keep hitting me,
I'll be scrap metal in no time.

66
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,557
This foe is beyond any of us.

67
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,470
We must run.

68
00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:54,020
Not a good plan.

69
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:57,477
Come to think of it, this is the first
time we've fought a Stratum Lord head-on.

70
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,777
Until now, we've exploited
their weak points.

71
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:01,677
And being under the Nether
Lord's command might

72
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:04,289
have made the other
ones weaker than usual.

73
00:04:04,820 --> 00:04:05,650
Change!

74
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,980
Quick, this way!

75
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:14,930
Come on, go!

76
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:17,860
Our feet is getting away!

77
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:21,671
As if that would make anyone stop running!

78
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:27,457
It sure is sounding real loud
and scary back there, Bobso!

79
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:29,560
You could even win a reward!

80
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:42,970
Damn!

81
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,117
What should I do?

82
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:46,760
Think! Water? Ice? Flames?

83
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:50,780
So much food!

84
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,180
Meat made everywhere!

85
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:53,690
What?

86
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:56,730
What?

87
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:58,291
It's eating the monsters!

88
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,417
Oh, I get it.

89
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,330
They're really hungry.

90
00:05:00,413 --> 00:05:01,857
Their stomachs must outweigh their anger.

91
00:05:01,940 --> 00:05:06,840
In that case, I'll give them my
personal fave, authentic barbecue sauce.

92
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,250
What's that?

93
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:12,740
It smells so yummy.

94
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,860
It is so yummy.

95
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:22,019
That's the real deal stuff for you.

96
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:24,141
This should buy us a little time.

97
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,200
I am sorry.

98
00:05:28,900 --> 00:05:32,397
I should have told you all more about
the Stratum Lord before we went in there.

99
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:35,833
What are we supposed to do
against an opponent like that?

100
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:38,960
Normally, I'd respond with
a carefree, hello there.

101
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,532
But I don't know either.

102
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:44,117
Instead of being useful,
I was just a burden.

103
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,900
I'm sorry, Master Boxo.

104
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:48,865
And I allowed my anger
to get the better of me.

105
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:51,901
I apologize for exposing
everyone to grave danger.

106
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:56,910
Boxo's right.

107
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:00,109
Apologizing will not
improve the situation.

108
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,857
Instead, let us think on
what to do about that ogre.

109
00:06:02,940 --> 00:06:04,764
At least our choices are clear.

110
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:07,120
We can either run away or defeat it.

111
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,137
It's too strong of an opponent.

112
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:11,217
I think we should consider running.

113
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,757
But we left Tashtay in there.

114
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:13,877
He could get away.

115
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,357
Chances are he's already dead,

116
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:18,777
or more likely that the dual ogre
will eat him in a matter of minutes.

117
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:22,057
Not even that magic skull ring could
bring the foul monster to bear.

118
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:25,057
Well, to be fair, the skull ring
can only handle simple commands.

119
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:27,022
When it comes to a Stratum Lord,

120
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,937
signaling it to attack is
the most one could hope for.

121
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:33,377
So speaking of Tashtay's skull
ring, if the dual ogre ate it,

122
00:06:33,460 --> 00:06:36,037
there's no chance the ogre would
then gain control of it, right?

123
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,540
Oh, Lamas, that's not...

124
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,340
not outside the realm of possibility.

125
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,337
And if it were to come to pass,

126
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:46,517
the Stratum Lord would suddenly be
in control of a slew of monsters.

127
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:49,277
What if it uses those monsters
to attack the village?

128
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,317
It appears we've narrowed
down our options.

129
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,877
We should take it down once and for all.

130
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,100
But I'll defer to you, Master Boxo.

131
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:59,377
I would appreciate it if a decision
like that were not up to me, Michele.

132
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:02,560
Um, guys, did you forget
that I'm a vending machine?

133
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,917
What exactly are you hoping for from me?

134
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,647
No, I can't think like that.

135
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:09,700
Okay, er, uh, Bill, it is...

136
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,417
Need more information?

137
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,330
You've got it.

138
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:15,020
It has two heads.

139
00:07:15,260 --> 00:07:17,378
The right is male, the left, female.

140
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:21,317
They seem to disagree on things
sometimes, but they basically get along.

141
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:25,440
Its body is much tougher than
steel, and you've seen its power.

142
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:29,140
It probably tops even Lamas
in terms of its raw strength.

143
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:31,618
My attacks are formidable, no doubt.

144
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:34,197
But aren't Lamas' and
Mishuel's even more so?

145
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:36,897
I thought they could penetrate
something as strong as steel.

146
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:39,497
We need to determine the
dual ogre's blessings, too.

147
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:40,757
Blessing of might, yeah?

148
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:41,670
Seems obvious.

149
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:46,140
Yeah, that power was off the charts.

150
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,177
And the problematic one is hardening.

151
00:07:48,260 --> 00:07:49,857
That makes it way tougher all around.

152
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:53,352
Yeah, that would partly explain
why my attack didn't work.

153
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:55,597
So blessing of might and hardening.

154
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,657
Sounds simple, but it is hard to beat.

155
00:07:57,740 --> 00:08:01,097
We maybe could have worked something
out if the captain were here with us.

156
00:08:01,180 --> 00:08:03,062
Yes, the blessing of eye breach.

157
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:05,577
There's no use in wishing
for what we don't have.

158
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:07,757
We'll just have to work
with what we've got.

159
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,670
Wise words.

160
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,420
Now what do we have?

161
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:13,349
We know it's a big
eater and heavy drinker.

162
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:15,969
Huh, that sounds a lot
like Japanese ogres.

163
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:19,937
There are old tales about attacking
them after you get them drunk.

164
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:20,980
Drunk? Alcohol!

165
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:24,080
I can offer it limitless alcohol! Okay!

166
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:33,160
Is this?

167
00:08:34,620 --> 00:08:35,900
Oh, it's booze.

168
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,677
And there's quite a lot of it.

169
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,617
Do we get that thing to drink all this?

170
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:40,540
Yeah, but how?

171
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:41,880
Good question.

172
00:08:42,380 --> 00:08:45,117
Maybe they'll drink it if a
pretty girl pours it for them.

173
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:47,717
What do we know about an ogre's
concept of beauty, though?

174
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,560
Uh-huh. Good point.

175
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:51,637
Well, we could find a pretty ogre lady.

176
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,817
Do you know any of those?

177
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:53,730
Ooh!

178
00:08:53,813 --> 00:08:55,917
Maybe we could make it
hallucinate a hot ogre lady.

179
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,837
I've had a fair number of
encounters with ogres in my time,

180
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,397
so it's not out of the question.

181
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:03,137
I don't know how to speak
their language, unfortunately.

182
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:06,337
I know of it, and I can teach you
a smattering at the very least.

183
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:09,837
Don't know if it'll work or not,
but we're all out of other ideas.

184
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,750
Hello there!

185
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:15,830
Hm. Boxo.

186
00:09:15,913 --> 00:09:18,660
Here he is, folks, a rock ogre monster.

187
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:21,617
But it's actually heavy with
an illusion cast on him.

188
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:26,171
And here I am on his back, transformed
into a vending machine made for kids.

189
00:09:26,660 --> 00:09:28,420
32-liter plastic bottles.

190
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:32,137
All the water inside's been replaced
with various alcoholic drinks.

191
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:34,080
Well, here goes nothing, Boxo.

192
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:38,537
If you decide it's too dangerous,
don't hesitate to retreat.

193
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:39,760
Please be careful.

194
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:51,880
Who are you?

195
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:54,420
What's a rock ogre doing in our lair?

196
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:57,797
That's ogre speak we learned from Hulemy.

197
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:59,351
It's a greeting of sorts.

198
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,000
What is that? Water?

199
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:03,971
Now let's get rid of the strings and caps.

200
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:07,480
I know this scent.

201
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,659
Who's my favorite?

202
00:10:11,620 --> 00:10:12,900
Oh, it's true.

203
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:13,997
They do like to drink.

204
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,300
But it wouldn't hurt to slow down.

205
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,900
Give me this one, too.

206
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,200
That's good.

207
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:25,499
I've never had a drink that
tastes like this before.

208
00:10:25,860 --> 00:10:27,817
I was just feeling thirsty, too.

209
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:29,600
What a thoughtful rock ogre.

210
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,240
Is there enough?

211
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:38,937
But those last two
bottles are the strongest.

212
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:40,844
Hopefully they'll do the trick.

213
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:46,240
The booze is making me feel
nice and sleepy. Let's rest.

214
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:48,520
Let it be a waste. Let's drink.

215
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,640
Whoa, it worked.

216
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:04,471
I don't think a drunk ogre is
going to wake up that easily.

217
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:08,347
What are we doing with that?

218
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,793
It's filled with booze.

219
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:10,710
Check it.

220
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:12,600
Okay, the needle went in.

221
00:11:13,180 --> 00:11:16,677
It appears they have to be conscious
to use the blessing of hardening.

222
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:19,917
This syringe was supposed to be for
taking out the elder tree fiend,

223
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,941
but it sure came in handy anyway.

224
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:27,217
I do feel kind of bad for attacking
this thing while it's asleep.

225
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:28,897
It pains me as well, but in my mind,

226
00:11:28,980 --> 00:11:31,517
there's no room for pity when
you're fighting a duel to the death.

227
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,980
Do you agree, Master Boxo? Yes.

228
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,720
Well, I suppose I'll take this side.

229
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,217
Think you can handle that side, Mishuo?

230
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:40,130
All right.

231
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,640
Yeah? What is it, Boxxo?

232
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,190
Huh?

233
00:11:46,273 --> 00:11:47,727
You said beat them with you?

234
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:49,320
Oh, I get it.

235
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:54,009
If you're the one who defeats the enemy,
then you'll gain the winning points.

236
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,500
Oh, I understand. Let's see then.

237
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:59,017
If I swing Boxxo and I hit them...

238
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:00,060
Hold on, Lamas.

239
00:12:00,220 --> 00:12:01,985
Let's attack at the same time.

240
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,070
All right!

241
00:12:03,260 --> 00:12:04,660
One, two, three!

242
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:09,930
That's a slap!

243
00:12:10,013 --> 00:12:13,557
Stratum lord for you even though i split
it three ways with llamas and Mishel

244
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:17,977
i still got over a million points is
it all right if i absorb the dual ogre

245
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:22,217
hold on just one more moment there's a
valuable part in here but i'm cool with

246
00:12:22,300 --> 00:12:26,657
you doing it after i retrieve that go
ahead kiko you much That's appreciated,

247
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:27,570
Hulemy.

248
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,670
Hmm?

249
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:44,349
We'd better do a quick recon
to see what became of Tash-Tay.

250
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:46,600
Indeed, I would be most grateful.

251
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:53,240
Did it just get cold in here? Sure did.

252
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:54,537
Is it coming from above?

253
00:12:54,620 --> 00:12:56,200
This is rather strange.

254
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:58,877
It's much colder in
here than it is outside.

255
